  "originalQuery": "As a Database Engineer, you are responsible for maintaining a high-performing Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL instance. The database has been experiencing performance issues, and you need to identify and resolve the problem without significantly impacting the database's availability. Which of the following strategies should you adopt?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Increase the number of vCPUs and memory allocated to the Cloud SQL instance.<br/>B. Migrate the database to a Cloud Spanner instance to improve performance.<br/>C. Disable the query planner to reduce query planning time.<br/>D. Use Cloud Monitoring to identify slow-running queries and create necessary indexes.",
  "domain": "Deploy scalable and highly available databases in Google Cloud",
  "hasImage": false,
