  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "290",
  "tip": "<p>Start with <i>observability</i> before scaling. Use Cloud SQL Insights and pg_stat_statements to find the top latency contributors then add the right indexes or tune the queries. Keep <i>autovacuum</i> enabled and consider <i>CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY</i> to reduce lock impact when indexing in PostgreSQL.</p>",
